{"title": "Food Supply Table 4", "pageid": 13556, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Food_Supply_Table_4", "categories": ["Drop tables", "Food supply tables"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>The <b>Food Supply Table 4</b>, also known as <code>Supplies_Food_4</code>&nbsp;<span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Supplies_Food_4+type:treasuretable\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Supplies_Food_4+type:treasuretable\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span>, is a non-leveled <a href=\"/wiki/Treasure_Table\" title=\"Treasure Table\">Treasure Table</a> containing medium <a href=\"/wiki/Camp_Supplies\" title=\"Camp Supplies\">camp supply</a> items. It is referenced in many drop tables.\n</p><p>Its name seems to be based on the fact that the average Supplies value of this table is approximately 4.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Drop_Table\">Drop Table</span></h3>\n<p><i>This is the actual contents of the drop table.</i>\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n  <th colspan=\"2\">Item</th>\n  <th>Quantity</th>\n  <th>Chance</th>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n\n\n<th style=\"text-align: left; padding: 0.4rem\" colspan=\"2\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fish_Supply_Table\" title=\"Fish Supply Table\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/aa/FOOD_Fish_%28Big%29_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-FOOD_Fish_%28Big%29_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/aa/FOOD_Fish_%28Big%29_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-FOOD_Fish_%28Big%29_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/a/aa/FOOD_Fish_%28Big%29_Unfaded_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/aa/FOOD_Fish_%28Big%29_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-FOOD_Fish_%28Big%29_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/aa/FOOD_Fish_%28Big%29_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Fish_Supply_Table\" title=\"Fish Supply Table\">Fish Supply Table</a></span> </th>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">1</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">1/2</td></tr>\n<tr>\n\n\n<th style=\"text-align: left; padding: 0.4rem\" colspan=\"2\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Pig%27s_Head\" title=\"Pig's Head\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/34/FOOD_Pig%27s_Head_B_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-FOOD_Pig%27s_Head_B_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/34/FOOD_Pig%27s_Head_B_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-FOOD_Pig%27s_Head_B_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/34/FOOD_Pig%27s_Head_B_Unfaded_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/34/FOOD_Pig%27s_Head_B_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-FOOD_Pig%27s_Head_B_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/34/FOOD_Pig%27s_Head_B_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Pig%27s_Head\" title=\"Pig's Head\">Pig's Head</a></span> </th>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">1</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">1/2</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><i>The following is a flattened drop table.</i> <i><i>The following section can be transcluded into other pages with <code>{{:Food Supply Table 4}}</code>.</i></i>\n</p><p><i>The average drop from this table is worth 4.75 <a href=\"/wiki/Camp_Supplies\" title=\"Camp Supplies\">Camp Supplies</a>.</i>\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n  <th colspan=\"2\">Item</th>\n  <th>Quantity</th>\n  <th>Chance</th>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n\n\n<th style=\"text-align: left; padding: 0.4rem\" colspan=\"2\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fish_(big)\" title=\"Fish (big)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/aa/FOOD_Fish_%28Big%29_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-FOOD_Fish_%28Big%29_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/aa/FOOD_Fish_%28Big%29_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-FOOD_Fish_%28Big%29_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/a/aa/FOOD_Fish_%28Big%29_Unfaded_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/aa/FOOD_Fish_%28Big%29_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-FOOD_Fish_%28Big%29_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/aa/FOOD_Fish_%28Big%29_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Fish_(big)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Fish (big)\">Fish (big)</a></span> </th>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">1</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">1/8</td></tr>\n<tr>\n\n\n<th style=\"text-align: left; padding: 0.4rem\" colspan=\"2\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fish\" title=\"Fish\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/75/FOOD_Fish_B_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-FOOD_Fish_B_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/75/FOOD_Fish_B_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-FOOD_Fish_B_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/7/75/FOOD_Fish_B_Unfaded_Icon.png 2x\"